        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Howard Devoto, Pete Shelley\n- Bands: Buzzcocks, Magazine\n- Albums: Jerky Versions of the Dream\n- Places: Bolton, England\n\nFacts:\n- In 1976, Buzzcocks formed in Bolton, England.\n- Pete Shelley was a singer-songwriter-guitarist who co-founded Buzzcocks.\n- Howard Devoto was a singer-songwriter who co-founded Buzzcocks.\n- Howard Devoto was the original singer of Buzzcocks.\n- Howard Devoto was also the original singer of Magazine.\n- Jerky Versions of the Dream is the only solo album recorded by Howard Devoto.",
